// array_insert into a resizable array whose count was set below 0, with
// bounds checks off (issue #158, spec 3.17, 8.1;
// resizable_array_negative_count_unchecked.flags): no bounds check fails
// the count, but the array's count is still checked, and the program
// stops at the built-in's name.
main :: () {
    a : [..]int;
    array_add(*a, 7);
    a.count = -1;
    array_insert(*a, 0, 5);
}
